      "language": "python",
      "relation": "finite_angle_definition_checker",
      "status": "reference_only",
      "path": "reference/python/right_triangle.py",
      "warning": "此程式只在有限精度與指定容差下檢查具體角度輸入，不等同於幾何定義本身。",
      "source": "from math import isclose\n\ndef is_right_triangle_angles(alpha, beta, gamma, *, tol=1e-9):\n    angles = (alpha, beta, gamma)\n    if min(angles) <= 0:\n        return False\n    return isclose(sum(angles), 180.0, abs_tol=tol) and any(isclose(x, 90.0, abs_tol=tol) for x in angles)",
      "non_identity": {
